| description = [[File:Npc_cinder_goblin.png|right]]Red-skinned [[Goblin]]s in [[Solusek's Eye]] and [[Lavastorm]] areas. Unlike the ice goblins of [[Vox]], [[Nagafen]] does not seem to care if players wipe out these possibly associated goblins of fire.

The largest concentration of these fiery fart-knockers can be found in their fortress built into the first areas of [[Solusek's Eye]]. There you can find the [[goblin merchant]], [[Solusek Goblin King]], and [[Lord Gimblox]]. They cohabit the zone with the gnomes of [[Solusek Mining Co]] but do not give opposing faction hits, suggesting an uneasy truce.

